  "result": "Perfect! All 130 tests pass. I've successfully added voucher functionality to the invoicing system:\n\n**New `applyVoucher()` in `src/invoices.js`:**\n- Applies a fixed-amount voucher to a draft invoice\n- Takes `{ code, amount }` where amount is in cents\n- Returns `ok(newInvoice)` with `invoice.voucher = { code, amount }`\n- Restrictions:\n  - Draft invoices only (NOT_DRAFT error)\n  - One voucher per invoice (VOUCHER_EXISTS error)\n  - Amount must be a positive integer (AMOUNT_INVALID error)\n- Never mutates input invoice\n\n**Updated `invoiceTotals()`:**\n- Now returns `{ subtotal, discount, vat, voucher, total }`\n- `voucher` = the voucher amount (0 if no voucher)\n- `total = subtotal - discount + vat - voucher` (clamped at 0)\n- Voucher is applied **after VAT** as specified\n\n**Added VOUCHER_EXISTS error** to `src/errors.js`\n\n**Tests added (7 new):**\n- Applying voucher to draft invoice\n- Rejecting vouchers on non-draft invoices\n- Rejecting invalid amounts (zero, negative, decimal)\n- Rejecting duplicate vouchers\n- No mutation of input invoices\n- Voucher included in invoiceTotals calculation\n- Voucher amount being 0 when absent\n\nThe voucher system integrates seamlessly with discounts, VAT, and the existing calculation flow: the total calculation properly subtracts the voucher from the amount after applying discounts and VAT.",
